== EEG and EOG based Real-Time Driver Fatigue Detection
/Jun 2022 -- Aug 2022/ | [https://github.com/dttutty/SEED-VIG-CNN GitHub] \n
/China Graduate Electronics Design Contest/

- Developed a module to translate MATLAB data to Python pickle dumps.
- Designed a CNN-based network to fuse EEG and EOG features for real-time driver-fatigue detection.
- Prepared presentation slides and a poster for demonstration.

== A Malfunction Detection System for Guangzhou Metro System
/Apr 2022 -- Jun 2023/

- Developed image preprocessing to combine source images and generate target-area images based on carriage characteristics.
- Adopted YOLOv5 and Fast R-CNN in the malfunction-detection process.
- Developed a module to fuse recognition results and provide a Flask API.
- Created a Docker Compose deployment for the frontend, Java backend, Python backend, and database.

